      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LIVING (1) is in sizzling form lately, rocketing around this track in 29.69 to score two back then following on with a 29.75 win over 515m at this track. Running fast times and looks the one to beat again. DON'T TELL TOMMY (6) has a strong record this track and trip with seven wins and four placings from 13 starts. Missed the frame latest (19.81) when fifth over 340m at Hobart in a Grade 5. With even luck and a clean start can sneak into the finish. RUPEE'S ROCKET (4) has a strong record this journey here with six wins and a minor from nine starts. Was out of the placings last time (30.06) at this track in a Grade 1/2, finishing fourth and beaten 6 lengths. Can feature in the finish. CRYSTAL (2) was a surprise last-start placegetter worth considering.",
